BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Day porter pricing splits into three camps. The Janitorial Store's Steve loads an $18/hr wage with taxes and profit into a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm ($26/hr bill rate, converts 20 hours a week into 87 billable hours a month, and quotes a flat $2,262/mo rather than an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (hourly number [1c9Ty46MQbg @ 00:01:46]. Commercial Cleaning CEO runs both models side by side: pay $17 and) Tj ET
