BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (markup, that same channel puts evening work near 2x cost but porters at roughly 30-35%. An alternative is cost plus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm ($1,000/mo for each of the first five porters and $750 or $500 after that, and some operators drop as low as 20-25%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([HahI_OcnGVA @ 00:08:40]. OctoClean's Matt and Greg stretch the range wider, discussing 10-40% margins. They) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (openly accept a porter that runs as 'a wash' if it secures the night crew. The second split is about selling. Commercial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Cleaning CEO pitches porters as an upsell to busy or complaining clients to lift contract value and stickiness, while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (OctoClean reports that selling a porter to a client who does not already have one is rare [52I2LNERY3E @ 00:20:55].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Which niche prints the most money is contested even inside one channel. Commercial Cleaning CEO founded in 2019) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (and was 97%+ medical by the pandemic, at about $550k/yr roughly one year in. That operator steers others to private) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (medical offices rather than hospitals and flags experienced competitors and slow trust-building as the drawback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm ([gqEvFieh5-k @ 00:02:15]. The same operator now calls industrial its most profitable segment, after starting in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (medical [8jCIs_UmQ1Q @ 00:00:37]. OctoClean reads medical competition the opposite way: because 'people's lives) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (are at risk,' the competition is limited. Its entry ramp is dialysis and dental, treated as lightly regulated 'practice') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (accounts, before moving into outpatient surgery centers where terminal cleaning vocabulary is mandatory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ([KNxKwtNpe_s @ 00:11:02]. Payment terms shift the math as well. Local credit unions pay in under 30 days versus) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (30-60 for property managers. Their price per 5,000 ft2 runs lower than medical, but so does the cost, and they come in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (packs of HQ, support buildings and branches [gqEvFieh5-k @ 00:08:50]. Property-manager accounts, by contrast,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (should never be expected to pay upfront. Monthly billing is the default, weekly invoicing works but adds admin, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (invoicing ahead is the middle ground [TCaVkVk94bc @ 00:11:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (Entry playbooks diverge hard. Commercial Cleaning CEO goes through the front door. Search the largest employers in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (the city, find single-tenant buildings with 50-100 parking spaces on Google Maps, and ask purchasing how to become a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (vendor. Then wait for the annual RFQ or RFP and follow up every 1-3 months, pitching strip and wax, carpet, ducts or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (windows as a foot in the door [-IxCGolievQ @ 00:09:08]. For property managers, the same channel prefers the back) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (door: alliances with symbiotic commercial trades that feed referrals, or a risk-free free cleaning trial backed by sample) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (reports, because you have to give big first [TCaVkVk94bc @ 00:17:37]. victoria menifee skips cold prospecting) Tj ET
