BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 245.52 Tm (Detail: Sharps go straight into a rigid puncture-proof container via mechanical tools [Training Videos - AxPTARAhtdA) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 230.30 Tm (@ 00:02:15]; pour absorbent powder or lay towels gently without stomping, then scrape from the outside edges inward) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.07 Tm (into the red biohazard bag [Training Videos - AxPTARAhtdA @ 00:02:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 199.85 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 184.62 Tm (Title: Disinfect and Hold the Dwell Time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.40 Tm (Action: Spray a 1:10 bleach mix or EPA-registered disinfectant and keep the surface wet for the full labeled contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.17 Tm (time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.95 Tm (Detail: OctoClean holds a 1:10 household bleach mix wet for three minutes [OctoClean Media - Z8hsIGjmi_c @) Tj ET
