BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Action: Seal the bag, remove PPE head to toe with gloves last, wash hands, and record the incident.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Detail: BuddSafety doffs head to toe and always removes gloves last [BuddSafety - eEnUgYz8rXU @ 00:02:41];) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Imperial Brady records the date, time, circumstances, and actions taken and reports to a supervisor or the person named) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (in the exposure control plan [Imperial Brady - tCz-yNw0WBo @ 00:08:23].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (The kit is the starting gun. Training Videos says every BBP spill kit carries four essential components: an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (EPA-registered disinfectant, absorbent material, tools for handling sharps, and disposal supplies such as biohazard bags) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (and sharps containers, and tells workers to locate the kits in their zone before they need them [AxPTARAhtdA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (00:01:18]. Training Videos also specifies shoe covers so contaminants are not tracked across the floor. The Bethel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (University instructor works out of a self-contained packet holding gloves, towels, a fluid solidifier powder, a small) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (shovel, and a scraper [jf-dh46niMw @ 00:02:42]. Imperial Brady lays out the CDC donning order: gown first, covering) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (neck to knees and arms to the end of the wrists and fastened at the back; then the mask with a fit check below the chin;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (then goggles or a face shield; and disposable gloves last, pulled up over the gown cuffs [tCz-yNw0WBo @ 00:03:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Imperial Brady adds that extra PPE may be optional on small spills but is still highly recommended, while larger spills) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (will likely require eyewear, a mask, and a gown. BuddSafety warns that kits are not all the same, so crews must follow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (whatever procedure is printed in the box at their site, and anyone without a kit should call their manager immediately) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm ([eEnUgYz8rXU @ 00:06:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (Disinfection is where the numbers live. Greg at OctoClean mixes 2 1/4 cups of tap water with 1/4 cup of 5.25 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (household bleach to hit the 1:10 dilution, and runs a three-minute dwell, meaning the surface must stay wet for three) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (minutes to work [Z8hsIGjmi_c @ 00:00:59]. The Bethel instructor builds a 10 percent bleach solution in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (100-fluid-ounce spray bottle by adding 10 fluid ounces of bleach first and topping off with water, calls it cheap and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (easy, but keeps it off carpet and jerseys because it is only for hard surfaces [jf-dh46niMw @ 00:04:00]. BuddSafety's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (germicidal wipes get a two-minute sit: saturate the area and wait two minutes or until it air dries before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (moist-towelette finish wipe [eEnUgYz8rXU @ 00:00:38]. Imperial Brady insists the product be an EPA-registered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (disinfectant that names HIV or HBV on its efficacy data sheet, that cleaning and disinfecting run as two separate steps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (unless you use a cleaner-disinfectant, and that skipping the labeled contact time means you have not truly disinfected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (anything [tCz-yNw0WBo @ 00:05:19]. Training Videos calls the disinfectant step the most frequently missed of its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (eight and says the area must remain visibly wet for the full time on the bottle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (The back half of the job is bagging, doffing, and paperwork. Greg at OctoClean opens the biohazard bag before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (touching the spill so there is no reaching in and out, swaps to fresh gloves before grabbing the clean disinfectant bottle,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (then ties the bag with a single knot while handling only the top and outside, held away from the body, and drops it into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (a watertight container such as a rolling trash can [Z8hsIGjmi_c @ 00:05:07]. BuddSafety doffs head to toe with gloves) Tj ET
