BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (minute is the working number even though the longer it sits the better [jf-dh46niMw @ 00:04:59]. Imperial Brady) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (refuses any shortcut: skip the manufacturer's recommended contact time and you have not truly disinfected anything,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (because the pathogens are not fully eliminated and the surface stays contaminated [tCz-yNw0WBo @ 00:05:19]. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Training Videos module flags disinfectant dwell as the most frequently missed step of its eight-step protocol and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (requires the area to remain visibly wet for the full time listed on the bottle [AxPTARAhtdA @ 00:02:50]. All four land) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (on the same discipline once the spray hits: leave the product untouched until its stated time has elapsed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (The second fault line is scope: which fluids trigger the full kit. Active Learning teaches that saliva, sweat, tears, urine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (and vomit usually do not carry bloodborne pathogens unless blood is actually visible, while still telling crews to treat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (anything where blood might be present as infectious [WPuiNvUKURw @ 00:00:57]. The Massachusetts Department of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Labor Standards webinar run by Mary Doha goes further for municipal crews, listing urine, vomit, spit, sweat and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (sewage water as gross and capable of making a worker sick but not bloodborne pathogens [4xmWcKLIfmA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (00:29:53]. XO Safety sits on the opposite side, naming vomit and feces among the fluids OSHA treats as potentially) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (infectious material to be handled the same as blood [-8zP-by6RbU @ 00:01:17]. Joe at Keep It Clean settles it for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (contractors with a field question: when a kid throws up at a school, the vomit only counts if blood from an ulcer or torn) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (stomach lining is in it, but are you going to take the time to test it? So you act as though it is [8EjRhmcPsz0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (00:01:11]. Keep It Clean ties that to the accounts contractors actually service: lobbies where people slip and hit their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (heads, office buildings, stores, just about anywhere.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (Hand hygiene and training spend split the room too. The Training Videos module demands soap and warm water for at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (least 20 seconds and calls hand sanitizer only a temporary measure that does not replace washing [AxPTARAhtdA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (00:03:29], while BuddSafety's technician closes every spill with a 30-second wash [eEnUgYz8rXU @ 00:06:16]. Mary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (Doha takes the field view: soap and water is the best first choice near a sink, but for a crew working out of a pickup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (truck, hand sanitizer is completely acceptable after pulling gloves [4xmWcKLIfmA @ 00:19:19]. On training, Joe at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (Keep It Clean argues the OSHA 8 and OSHA 10 cards are very expensive and heavy on legal jargon for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (high-turnover workforce where English may not be the first language, so the company built a course pitched at a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (fourth-to-fifth grade reading level, priced under $30 with an audio version and in-line testing [8EjRhmcPsz0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (00:02:03]. The Keep It Clean hosts also agree OSHA does not really sanction training that is not its own, pitching the) Tj ET
