BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.97 Tm (inside the same tax year, which they call a huge red flag [VumHp7Ist1c @ 00:04:06]. The pattern is consistent: the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 292.75 Tm (audit rarely starts with an agent hunting you; all it takes is one worker walking into unemployment and filing a claim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 277.52 Tm ([YC2NrvVJqlg @ 00:08:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 262.30 Tm (The second trap is a paper label that the daily operation contradicts. Jon Margalit says most cleaning owners want the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.07 Tm (1099 tax advantages but assign specific schedules, hand out supplies, require uniforms, and dictate exactly how to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.85 Tm (clean, then are shocked when the state comes knocking [8gbn-TCd4l4 @ 00:01:51]. DJ The Boss watched owners label) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 216.62 Tm (part-timers as 1099s simply because they only had one day of work, and warns that someone with no clients other than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 201.40 Tm (you can still be reclassified as your employee on audit [cShuZhOvvr4 @ 00:04:34]. The Janitorial Store adds that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.17 Tm (training a sub to clean a house or office a certain way means they are not a sub [YC2NrvVJqlg @ 00:05:28]. BICO) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.95 Tm (Legal and Compliance Consulting shows how a signed agreement collapses: a take-it-or-leave-it independent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 155.72 Tm (contractor contract the worker had no ability to negotiate, while the owners set the worker's prices under threat of) Tj ET
